{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/FlatMap\/timeout(_:clock:tolerance:customError:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timeout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"duration","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency5ClockP8DurationQa","text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"clock","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tolerance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency5ClockP8DurationQa","text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"customError","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (any ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP","text":"Error","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")? = nil) -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO","text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO7TimeoutV","text":"Timeout","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Timeout"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency5ClockP","text":"Clock","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The longest the sequence may go without an element.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"duration"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The clock that measures the gaps."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"clock"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tolerance of the timer’s sleeps. Defaults to "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"tolerance"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The error to throw when the timer fires. Defaults to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"TimeoutError.timedOut(duration:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"customError"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A sequence of the same elements that throws if the upstream goes quiet."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The timer starts when iteration begins and restarts with every element, so it bounds the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wait for the first element and each gap after it, never the sequence as a whole. Elements","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pass through unchanged. When the timer fires, the upstream is cancelled and the sequence","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"throws, without waiting for the upstream to respond to the cancellation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The upstream is read ahead of the consumer, and elements it produces while the consumer is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"busy are buffered, so the timer measures the upstream’s gaps. A duration of zero or less"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws before the first element."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Example","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let clock = ContinuousClock()","for try await line in bytes.lines.timeout(.seconds(30), clock: clock) {","    handle(line)","}"]},{"type":"aside","name":"Throws","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"code":"TimeoutError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (or "},{"code":"customError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") when "},{"code":"duration","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" passes between elements, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any error the upstream throws."}]}],"style":"note"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/flatmap\/timeout(_:clock:tolerance:customerror:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"iPadOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"Mac Catalyst","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"9.0","name":"watchOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false}],"externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE7timeout_5clock9tolerance11customErrorAA14AsyncSequencesO7TimeoutVy_xqd__G8DurationQyd___qd__AOSgs0H0_pSgt12_Concurrency5ClockRd__lF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14As